      "mergeID": "5b60e930af9fd5457d44f14d",
      "mergedPostDetails": "There is currently a bug I am experiencing in The Great Pug and The Vantage where my viewpoint is moved to a random spot in the world far from my avatar. I have not noticed any correlations with when it happens yet.\n\nThis started happening during the patch that introduced new routing for voice.\n\nThis is _not_ from hackers. I have had it happen in private instances with trusted friends.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Master Client Viewpoint is Randomly Moved Far from Their Avatar",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5b0ff2a957e87878836957eb",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I had similar issue in avatar testing world, what was weird my viewpoint was connected to some random object that other players were able to move. And this was happening to anyone who joined to world - it just broke at some point and every new joined player was affected by this issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
