  "details": "Reproduce steps:\n1. Use a station to sit.\n2. Open quick menu and go to another world while sitting.\n3. Then, another player (not using station) is suddenly moved to that station location.\n\nTested client version: 2018.1.3.\n\nNotes:\n- It seems 100% reproducible.\n- Shutting down client also reproduce this issue.\n- Movement of another player is sometimes done in \"incomplete\" way especially in Y-axis. The avatar location and view point (= player camera location) might be separated.",
